            "thoughtSignature": "CugCAY89a18ynUzreXQ23t3QnhJ8cZ-bTKtKyCqjLG2EPJTW6hXeqiXH631G4zl3__OCe5d68ScF3k3PVEGvvXZcoKBFe2Y02sUO-LBtKbTnFONLx_EZ9fkg3l8zWKc0yT5MS0inKuBrM8kHYgOrtoc5_J-aqJN1Q-bsBUzoJYaSbNrhVl2huc-4oKCIXZD0Jg6le58ZYUjLNvwIBUHiIZUleMnt3iSuCvTjFLG7sLeLbYyvkrGmYBIzLHUK3qmn9fsJqOYMmvkiFBoTuTNH-yypat-aYrRXOMerGBiZVGf0eLUo29457mungFtpUGvI8OzVejUVw2K6p4ulAEJVc3bdnh2-7RW70au_2eIhs_pHlfEehJDXzE3X7Z-F-1gnz2JWLvRcAWhRdIfIQeP6vJ-KbAB_NiVieOj6fpzlWun8EdGuulgiWvH86dFcZP4iRD8anDEgx4OiY-eiLs3zgpHJaYGpRjjQMuTm"
